    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0010:0001",
      "source": "The default value is [`zero`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/CoreFoundation/CGSize/zero), which generates images at the asset’s unscaled dimensions.",
      "ko": "기본값은 [`zero`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/CoreFoundation/CGSize/zero)이며, 에셋의 크기 조정되지 않은 치수로 이미지를 생성합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "ed98d131cd5c3ab0eeb125a3295267deeeb100872ee77f1d9010cbf8c718a3d4",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0011:0001",
      "source": "Setting a size scales images to fit their defined bounding boxes.",
      "ko": "크기를 설정하면 이미지는 정의된 바운딩 박스에 맞도록 스케일됩니다.",
      "sourceHash": "f2fef777fd399b301d12d093849cf22b2b5a4fd52c2dbd78aca0f19884abf324",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0011:0002",
      "source": "You define the aspect ratio of the scaled image by setting a value for the [`apertureMode`](avassetimagegenerator/aperturemode-swift.property.md) property.",
      "ko": "You define the aspect ratio of the scaled image by setting a value for the [`apertureMode`](avassetimagegenerator/aperturemode-swift.property.md) property.",
